	"system": {
		"description": {
			"gm": "",
			"value": "<p><strong>Usage</strong> drawn on a creature or object</p><hr><p>This rune is often placed on a stone in a hearth, its power ensuring the stone remains warm through the night. The bearer's fire resistance, if any, is reduced by [[ floor(@actor.level / 2) + 5]]. Its immunities are unaffected.</p><p><strong>Invocation</strong> The bearer takes @Damage[ceil(@actor.level / 2)d8[fire]] damage with a @Check[fortitude|basic|against:runesmith] save. On a critical failure, it's also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} for 1 round.</p><hr><p><strong>Level (+2)</strong> The reduction in fire resistance increases by 1, and the damage of the invocation increases by [[/r 1d8]].</p>"
		},
